  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pilot project for the substitution of old domestic/commercial refrigeration appliances with new energy efficient products</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNIDO submitted a project proposal to the Kigali Cooling Efficiency Program (K-CEP) for the promotion of sustainable solutions in Mexico through a pilot project for the replacement of about 8,000 old domestic and commercial self-contained refrigerators for new efficient ones (within the rate of the Mexican MEPS established for refrigerators).</narrative>
  </description>
